    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nWrite a program that greets the user.\r\n\r\nRun your program to test it.\r\n* **\r\n**Open the *AI Tutor* on the right and ask it to _CLARIFY what the INSTRUCTIONS mean_ and how you might start.**\r\n\r\n\r\nYou can type things like:\r\n* _What does \"greet the user\" mean in Python? Please explain in simple steps._\r\n* _Can you give me a very short example of a program that greets the user?_\r\n* _Do I need to ask for a name or is a simple \"hello\" okay for this level?_\r\n* _What Python command shows text on the screen?_\r\n",
